:"U_kgDOCQqC6Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berkyalkn/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berkyalkn/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berkyalkn/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berkyalkn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berkyalkn/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/berkyalkn","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/berkyalkn/AI-travel-agent/commits/f1c0d0c75c88ebd21c8725020d2eef9a82e5536a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-09-04T18:57:37Z","email":"berky.alknn@gmail.com","name":"Berkay Alkan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-09-04T18:57:37Z","email":"berky.alknn@gmail.com","name":"Berkay Alkan"},"message":"feat(agent): Implement detailed flight parsing and reporting\n\nOverhauls the entire flight data pipeline to handle and display detailed, real-world flight information, including multi-leg journeys with layovers. This significantly enhances the richness and utility of the final generated itinerary.\n\n- **Schemas:** The `FlightLeg` and `FlightInfo` Pydantic models are updated to include specific fields like `flight_number`, `aircraft_type`, and optional layover details.\n\n- **Tool Logic:** The parser within `flight_search_tool` is now a robust, defensive function that can handle the complex and inconsistent JSON structure from the live flight API. It correctly identifies direct vs. layover flights and extracts the relevant data for each.\n\n- **Report Formatting:** The `report_formatter_node` is updated to generate a professional Markdown table for flight details. It now displays departure/return dates, times, flight numbers, aircraft types, and conditionally includes layover information (airport and duration) if a flight is not direct.","tree":{"sha":"73918a093d29abf13e4c7aa0e254d905f821af2a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/berkyalkn/AI-travel-agent/git/trees/73918a093d29abf13e4c7aa0e254d905f821af2a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/berkyalkn/AI-travel-agent/git/commits/f1c0d0c75c88ebd21c8725020d2eef9a82e5536a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151683817?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berkyalkn/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berkyalkn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berkyalkn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berkyalkn/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/berkyalkn","id":151683817,"login":"berkyalkn","node_id":"U_kgDOCQqC6Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berkyalkn/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berkyalkn/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berkyalkn/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berkyalkn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berkyalkn/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/berkyalkn","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/berkyalkn/AI-travel-agent/commit/f1c0d0c75c88ebd21c8725020d2eef9a82e5536a","node_id":"C_kwDOPTOlxtoAKGYxYzBkMGM3NWM4OGViZDIxYzg3MjUwMjBkMmVlZjlhODJlNTUzNmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/berkyalkn/AI-travel-agent/commit/e2ad1b861e297e47d4863a0867d11f43aa1f450d","sha":"e2ad1b861e297e47d4863a0867d11f43aa1f450d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/berkyalkn/AI-travel-agent/commits/e2ad1b861e297e47d4863a0867d11f43aa1f450d"}],"sha":"f1c0d0c75c88ebd21c8725020d2eef9a82e5536a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/berkyalkn/AI-travel-agent/commits/f1c0d0c75c88ebd21c8725020d2eef9a82e5536a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151683817?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ber