 and project structure\n- Platform compatibility matrix and browser support details\n- Step-by-step quick start guide and deployment instructions\n- Performance metrics and bundle analysis information\n- Best practices guidelines for when to use this starter kit\n\n🎯 GitHub Repository Management:\n- Professional issue templates (Bug Report, Feature Request, Documentation, Question)\n- Comprehensive pull request template with detailed checklists\n- Contributing guidelines with development workflow and coding standards\n- Security policy with responsible disclosure process\n- GitHub issue configuration with contact links\n\n📚 Documentation Standards:\n- World-class example for React Native Web starter kit repositories\n- Structured for different audience levels (beginners to advanced)\n- Cross-platform considerations throughout all documentation\n- Professional formatting with tables, code examples, and visual hierarchy\n- Clear call-to-actions and community engagement guidelines\n\n🏆 Repository Excellence:\n- Model repository structure for other React Native Web projects\n- Comprehensive developer onboarding process\n- Professional issue management and contribution workflows\n- Security-first approach with vulnerability reporting process\n- Community-focused with multiple engagement channels","tree":{"sha":"7d1404dfa2f62e440074725b587013aa28d4477f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/markhazleton/react-native-web-start/git/trees/7d1404dfa2f62e440074725b587013aa28d4477f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/markhazleton/react-native-web-start/git/commits/21444725a5858c06dfda232f0a68d7e8bbbd5ded","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/markhazleton/react-native-web-start/commit/21444725a5858c06dfda232f0a68d7e8bbbd5ded","node_id":"C_kwDOPTQJv9oAKDIxNDQ0NzI1YTU4NThjMDZkZmRhMjMyZjBhNjhkN2U4YmJiZDVkZWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/markhazleton/re