e4f5d2bc1849c185e54c1040394ae0700c10bfe4"}],"sha":"4546c0cf2298d92785cbd85c269fb4803ee5ea22","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/markhazleton/react-native-web-start/commits/4546c0cf2298d92785cbd85c269fb4803ee5ea22"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/markhazleton/react-native-web-start/commits/e4f5d2bc1849c185e54c1040394ae0700c10bfe4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-07-26T17:59:43Z","email":"mark.hazleton@controlorigins.com","name":"Mark Hazleton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-07-26T17:59:43Z","email":"mark.hazleton@controlorigins.com","name":"Mark Hazleton"},"message":"🌐 Add GitHub Pages deployment configuration\n\n✨ Features:\n- Configure Vite base path for GitHub Pages subdirectory hosting\n- Add gh-pages deployment scripts to package.json\n- Set homepage URL for GitHub Pages deployment\n- Update TypeScript configuration for web builds\n- Add predeploy and deploy scripts for automated deployment\n\n📦 Deployment:\n- Base path: /react-native-web-start/ for GitHub Pages\n- Homepage: https://markhazleton.github.io/react-native-web-start\n- Automated build and deploy process with npm run deploy\n- Production-ready build with optimized bundle\n\n🚀 Usage:\n- npm run build: Build for production\n- npm run deploy: Build and deploy to GitHub Pages\n- npm run deploy:gh-pages: Combined build and deploy command\n\nThe React Native Web application is now ready for GitHub Pages hosting!","tree":{"sha":"afe00b7a273485082e345e5bf8ee296937288e7a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/markhazleton/react-native-web-start/git/trees/afe00b7a273485082e345e5bf8ee296937288e7a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/markhazleton/react-native-web-start/git/commits/e4f5d2bc1849c185e54c1040394ae0700c10bfe4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/markhazleton/react-native-web-start/commit/e4f5d2bc1849c185e54c1040394ae0700c10bfe4","node_id":"C_kwDOPTQJv9oAKGU0ZjVkMmJjMTg0OWMxODVlNTRjMTA0MDM5NGFlMDcwMGMxMGJmZTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/markhazleton/react-native-web-start/commit/7136e9844cf9ddf46d3707f60bb14d469c032d68","sha":"7136e9844cf9ddf46d3707f60bb14d469c032d68","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/markhazleton/react-native-web-start/commits/7136e9844cf9ddf46d3707f60bb14d469c032d68"}],"sha":"e4f5d2bc1849c185e54c1040394ae0700c10bfe4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/markhazleton/react-native-web-start/commits/e4f5d2bc1849c185e54c1040394ae0700c10bfe4"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/markhazleton/react-native-web-start/commits/7136e9844cf9ddf46d3707f60bb14d469c032d68/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-07-26T17:55:41Z","email":"mark.hazleton@controlorigins.com","name":"Mark Hazleton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-07-26T17:55:41Z","email":"mark.hazleton@controlorigins.com","name":"Mark Hazleton"},"message":"🚀 Initial React Native Web + Vite Starter with Documentation Browser\n\n✨ Features:\n- Complete cross-platform React Native Web application using Vite\n- TypeScript support with strict type checking\n- Cross-platform navigation with TabBar (Home, Jokes, Docs, About)\n- API integration with JokeAPI for demonstration\n- In-app documentation browser with markdown rendering\n- Platform-specific styling and optimizations\n- Comprehensive error handling and loading states\n\n📱 Platform Support:\n- Web: Fast development with Vite HMR at localhost:3000\n- iOS: React Native CLI configuration ready\n- Android: React Native CLI configuration ready\n- Responsive design for all screen sizes\n\n🛠️ Technical Architecture:\n- Vite build tool with React Native Web aliases\n- Metro configuration for mobile bundling\n- Babel configuration for React Native preset\n- TypeScript with proper cross-platform types\n- Service layer architecture for API calls\n- Component-based architecture with screen navigation\n\n📚 Documentation System:\n- In-app documentation browser with search functionality\n- Markdown renderer supporting headers, lists, code blocks, quotes\n- Documentation files served from public directory\n- File metadata display with size and modification dates\n- Comprehensive setup guides and technical analysis\n\n🎯 Key Components:\n- WelcomeScreen: Platform info and feature overview\n- JokesScreen: API integration with error handling\n- DocumentationScreen: File browser and markdown viewer\n- AboutScreen: Technology stack and resource links\n- Cross-platform TabBar navigation\n\n📦 Configuration Files:\n- package.json: Dependencies and scripts for all platforms\n- vite.config.ts: Optimized for React Native Web\n- tsconfig.json: Strict TypeScript configuration\n- metro.config.js: Mobile bundler configuration\n- babel.config.js: React Native preset\n\n🚀 Ready for Development:\n- npm run web: Start web development server\n- npm run android: Run on Android device/emulator\n- npm run ios: Run on iOS device/simulator (macOS only)\n- npm run build: Production web build\n- npm run type-check: TypeScript validation\n\n📖 Documentation:\n- Complete setup guide for all platforms\n- Project summary with achievements\n- Technical analysis of API integration\n- Step-by-step development instructions\n\nThis commit establishes a production-ready foundation for cross-platform React Native Web development with comprehensive documentation and modern tooling.","tree":{"sha":"679565a587addd84f55e31d5d8bb08f3dcc0f04b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/markhazleton/react-native-web-start/git/trees/679565a587addd84f55e31d5d8bb08f3dcc0f04b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/markhazleton/react-native-web-start/git/commits/7136e9844cf9ddf46d3707f60bb14d469c032d68","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/markhazleton/react-native-web-start/commit/7136e9844cf9ddf46d3707f60bb14d469c032d68","node_id":"C_kwDOPTQJv