uthor":{"account":{"login":"sahassakhare","providerType":"User"},"email":"sahassakhare@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Sahas Sakhare"},"authoredDate":"2025-08-01T02:28:54Z","committedDate":"2025-08-01T02:28:54Z","committer":{"account":{"login":"sahassakhare","providerType":"User"},"email":"sahassakhare@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Sahas Sakhare"},"observedAt":"2026-10-08T19:54:24.011Z","repositoryId":1026923917,"sha":"09aaffa2f4b6f575d370866e41b194da61b79c9b"},{"author":{"account":{"login":"sahassakhare","providerType":"User"},"email":"sahassakhare@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Sahas Sakhare"},"authoredDate":"2025-07-26T23:15:43Z","committedDate":"2025-07-26T23:15:43Z","committer":{"account":{"login":"sahassakhare","providerType":"User"},"email":"sahassakhare@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Sahas Sakhare"},"observedAt":"2026-10-08T19:54:24.011Z","repositoryId":1026923917,"sha":"51a891fe756c39ad62e57c1d9a74a5cdff224333"}],"observedAt":"2026-10-08T19:54:24.011Z","raw":[{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21344002?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sahassakhare","id":21344002,"login":"sahassakhare","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMzQ0MDAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sahassakhare/native-federation-universal/commits/e53a33fdef4387b708742c06b8329f42366f43a6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-05T18:58:08Z","email":"sahassakhare@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Sahas Sakhare"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-05T18:58:08Z","email":"sahassakhare@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Sahas Sakhare"},"message":"feat: comprehensive examples update and library rename utility\n\nMajor improvements to Native Federation examples and tooling:\n\n## Examples Improvements\n- **Complete Angular App**: Added real Native Federation runtime with working federation.config.js and build scripts\n- **React Example**: Updated to fully functional federation with proper ports (4300/4301) and working components\n- **Angular Example**: Fixed federation loader to use real Angular createComponent API instead of mock HTML\n- **All Examples**: Removed emojis from documentation for professional appearance\n\n## Missing Configuration Files Added\n- Added angular.json, tsconfig.json, and tsconfig.app.json to all Angular examples\n- Standardized Angular 18 configuration with standalone components support\n- Added missing federation.config.js files where needed\n- Ensured all examples have complete, consistent file structure\n\n## Library Rename Utility\n- **rename-library.js**: Comprehensive utility to rename the entire library and update all references\n- **Smart name transformations**: Handles kebab-case, camelCase, PascalCase, UPPER_CASE variations\n- **Complete coverage**: Updates JS, TS, JSON, MD, HTML, CSS, config files, and directories\n- **Safety features**: Automatic backups, dry-run mode, comprehensive validation\n- **Package management**: Updates package.json dependencies and scoped packages\n- **Test suite**: Automated testing with 8 validation scenarios\n- **Documentation**: Complete guides with examples and troubleshooting\n\n## Documentation Updates\n- Updated main examples README with accurate status for all examples\n- Removed all emojis for professional appearance\n- Added comprehensive documentation for rename utility\n- Updated status indicators: \"Fully Functional\" vs \"Well Documented\"\n\n## File Structure Completed\nAll 10 Angular example locations now have complete essential files:\n- angular.json (Angular CLI configuration)\n- tsconfig.json (TypeScript compiler settings)\n- tsconfig.app.json (Application-specific TypeScript)\n- package.json (Dependencies and scripts)\n- federation.config.js (Native Federation configuration)","tree":{"sha":"7a7cfd28603a7fde52f2d726c3c1a38ba638efc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sahassakhare/native-federation-universal/git/trees/7a7cfd28603a7fde52f2d726c3c1a38ba638efc5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sahassakhare/native-federation-universal/git/commits/e53a33fdef4387b708742c06b8329f42366f43a6","verification":{"payload":"tree 7a7cfd28603a7fde52f2d726c3c1a38ba638efc5\nparent 339fa0d0711fa53e171bdffde903fa102a5c9f76\nauthor Sahas Sakhare <sahassakhare@users.noreply.github.com> 1754420288 +0530\ncommitter Sahas Sakhare <sahassakhare@users.noreply.github.com> 1754420288 +0530\n\nfeat: comprehensive examples update and library rename utility\n\nMajor improvements to Native Federation examples and tooling:\n\n## Examples Improvements\n- **Complete Angular App**: Added real Native Federation runtime with working federation.config.js and build scripts\n- **React Example**: Updated to fully functional federation with proper ports (4300/4301) and working components\n- **Angular Example**: Fixed federation loader to use real Angular createComponent API instead of mock HTML\n- **All Examples**: Removed emojis from documentation for professional appearance\n\n## Missing Configuration Files Added\n- Added angular.json, tsconfig.json, and tsconfig.app.json to all Angular examples\n- Standardized Angular 18 configuration with standalone components support\n- Added missing federation.config.js files where needed\n- Ensured all examples have complete, consistent file structure\n\n## Library Rename Utility\n- **rename-library.js**: Comprehensive utility to rename the entire library and update all references\n- **Smart name transformations**: Handles kebab-case, camelCase, PascalCase, UPPER_CASE variations\n- **Complete coverage**: Updates JS, TS, JSON, MD, HTML, CSS, config files, and directories\n- **Safety features**: Automatic backups, dry-run mode, comprehensive validation\n- **Package management**: Updates package.json dependencies and scoped packages\n- **Test suite**: Automated testing with 8 validation scenarios\n- **Documentation**: Complete guides with examples and troubleshooting\n\n## Documentation Updates\n- Updated main examples README with accurate status for all examples\n- Removed all emojis for professional appearance\n- Added comprehensive documentation for rename utility\n- Updated status indicators: \"Fully Functional\" vs \"Well Documented\"\n\n## File Structure Completed\nAll 10 Angular example locations now have complete essential files:\n- angular.json (Angular CLI configuration)\n- tsconfig.json (TypeScript compiler settings)\n- tsconfig.app.json (Application-specific TypeScript)\n- package.json (Dependencies and scripts)\n- federation.config.js (Native Federation configuration)\n","reason":"bad_email","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQGzBAABCAAdFiEE1eujchKuJhYER67YWqdl9Lsba5AFAmiSVEAACgkQWqdl9Lsb\na5Copwv/dbuI7uhFzo/MmUQ9/Hq8yCmQucTXExgVtCmbBS9T+Z/U1ur4tg3zp5xR\n8OGDohD3X67VSPQOZo3WlAwYlA/X9JDZYMFSohRAWrDf2kvoW5RdtjChQZ7JBSEN\nUqlo/hyhCOegll/bLJor39Q4T9oGiIQHDJZzThu522CbKly1onP8qE/yp0B2vYNi\n1DF6uN2xebyKmQBFMZAocKGrNXS+1QA7lt+b+wb3o5r8MSgHf7KNDdJdEQZW4ytE\nKJApsWGmwernF1nK/YdvIhVh6XWkxwZbhBp1N9lIA5gVwqDd5op8E25MJN9kaPoD\nW0QGc4mVGh6IMTLDQ9MOu40CvYnF6mu3vSglQSWBR4pZ4okMJgZMGzh+ypUh2tWd\ngMgBRi4yFxlMI291721xph34YsmJahmDH57WvLKKTNY6U2MIcQAEXAN6lXBazPuf\nwbe/rQ/BcHdnSGW3FDBEI+lA2lMaTJ2CQJ6SD8hE1xEeUsGZYFYpoWauI5+DihrA\nlhZsGhUL\n=oVnF\n-----END P