Z","email":"weynomames53@gmail.com","name":"OscarMeza"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-06T13:30:57Z","email":"weynomames53@gmail.com","name":"OscarMeza"},"message":"Se añadió un script mejorado de datos de semillas y un informe completo de análisis de la base de datos.\n\n- Se introdujo un nuevo script de datos de semillas (`02-seed-data-improved.sql`) con categorías completas de alimentos, campañas de muestra, eventos de voluntariado y funciones auxiliares para la gestión del sistema.\n- Se creó un informe detallado de análisis de la base de datos (`ANALISIS_BASE_DE_DATOS.md`) que destaca los problemas críticos, las soluciones implementadas y las mejoras de rendimiento, incluyendo políticas de RLS, indexación, restricciones de validación, activadores y vistas de informes.","tree":{"sha":"cb8407e0ed652b2da36f816f88c73489df0f966f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OscarMeza24/BancoDeAlimentos/git/trees/cb8407e0ed652b2da36f816f88c73489df0f966f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OscarMeza24/BancoDeAlimentos/git/commits/9b56537c57c8d2da23f76a1d08005c89d51ba957","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/143342019?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OscarMeza24/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OscarMeza24/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OscarMeza24/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OscarMeza24/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/OscarMeza24","id":143342019,"login":"OscarMeza24","node_id":"U_kgDOCIs5ww","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OscarMeza24/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OscarMeza24/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OscarMeza24/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OscarMeza24/starred{/owner