-tayyeb/mfe-toolkit/commits/a7c9fd46fb84b36e1992df2bed3c2c08fd02fb25/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-09-02T12:13:10Z","email":"smt.jpi@gmail.com","name":"maysam-tayyeb"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-09-02T12:13:10Z","email":"smt.jpi@gmail.com","name":"maysam-tayyeb"},"message":"refactor: Use MFEErrorBoundary from @mfe-toolkit/react package\n\n- Remove container''s redundant MFEErrorBoundary wrapper\n- Use the more feature-rich MFEErrorBoundary from @mfe-toolkit/react\n  - Includes retry functionality with counter\n  - Better service integration (error reporter, logger)\n  - More polished error UI\n\n- Add app-level ErrorBoundary to App.tsx for global error handling\n- Update CompatibleMFELoader and RegistryMFELoader to use MFEErrorBoundary\n  - Wraps MFELoader components with proper error boundaries\n  - Provides better error isolation and recovery\n\nThis creates a two-tier error boundary architecture:\n1. App-level ErrorBoundary for general application errors\n2. MFEErrorBoundary for MFE-specific errors with retry capability\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1268c5e72191413b4d6c58fea879eee22989fcdd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maysam-tayyeb/mfe-toolkit/git/trees/1268c5e72191413b4d6c58fea879eee22989fcdd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maysam-tayyeb/mfe-toolkit/git/commits/a7c9fd46fb84b36e1992df2bed3c2c08fd02fb25","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2016099?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maysam-tayyeb/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maysam-tayyeb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maysam-tayyeb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maysam-tayyeb/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.c