owing{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maysam-tayyeb/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/maysam-tayyeb","id":2016099,"login":"maysam-tayyeb","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMTYwOTk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maysam-tayyeb/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maysam-tayyeb/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maysam-tayyeb/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maysam-tayyeb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maysam-tayyeb/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/maysam-tayyeb","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maysam-tayyeb/mfe-toolkit/commits/f13be8d944f33b47d258fc8ba99cf79f3d3dc3f1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-31T23:03:37Z","email":"smt.jpi@gmail.com","name":"maysam-tayyeb"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-31T23:03:37Z","email":"smt.jpi@gmail.com","name":"maysam-tayyeb"},"message":"refactor: Complete Phase 2 - Migrate all service packages to core\n\nBREAKING CHANGE: All service packages have been removed and consolidated into @mfe-toolkit/core\n\n## Changes\n- Moved Modal, Notification, Authentication, Authorization, Theme, and Analytics services to core\n- All service interfaces now in @mfe-toolkit/core/src/types/\n- All service implementations now in @mfe-toolkit/core/src/implementations/\n- Removed all @mfe-toolkit/service-* packages entirely\n- Updated container and MFEs to import from core\n- Maintained tree-shakability with generic export names\n\n## Benefits\n- Single package to install (@mfe-toolkit/core)\n- Lower barrier to entry for developers\n- Consistent architecture across all services\n- Containers can still swap implementations\n- Better tree-shaking with centralized exports\n\n## Migration Guide\nReplace all imports:\n- @mfe-toolkit/service-modal → @mfe-toolkit/core\n- @mfe-toolkit/service-notification → @mfe-toolkit/core\n- @mfe-toolkit/service-authentication → @mfe-toolkit/core\n- @mfe-toolkit/service-authorization → @mfe-toolkit/core\n- @mfe-toolkit/service-theme → @mfe-toolkit/core\n- @mfe-toolkit/service-analytics → @mfe-toolkit/core\n\n🤖 Generated with Claude Code\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"499f7b2bb402f2a28da610e9d61d4cbe8eb89e3b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maysam-tayyeb/mfe-toolkit/git/trees/499f7b2bb402f2a28da610e9d61d4cbe8eb89e3b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maysam-tayyeb/mfe-toolkit/git/commits/f13be8d944f33b47d258fc8ba99cf79f3d3dc3f1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2016099?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maysam-tayyeb/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maysam-tayyeb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maysam-tayyeb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maysam-tayyeb/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/maysam-tayyeb","id":2016099,"login":"maysam-tayyeb","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMTYwOTk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maysam-tayyeb/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maysam-tayyeb/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maysam-tayyeb/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maysam-tayyeb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maysam-tayyeb/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/maysam-tayyeb","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/maysam-tayyeb/mfe-toolkit/commit/f13be8d944f33b47d258fc8ba99cf79f3d3dc3f1","node_id":"C_kwDOPTYVLdoAKGYxM2JlOGQ5NDRmMzNiNDdkMjU4ZmM4YmE5OWNmNzlmM2QzZGMzZjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/maysam-tayyeb/mfe-toolkit/commit/f8b4cbe8000fe8ced59c1dfccea47cf86dcd0cb4","sha":"f8b4cbe8000fe8ced59c1dfccea47cf86dcd0cb4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maysam-tayyeb/mfe-toolkit/commits/f8b4cbe8000fe8ced59c1dfccea47cf86dcd0cb4"}],"sha":"f13be8d944f33b47d258fc8ba99cf79f3d3dc3f1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maysam-tayyeb/mfe-toolkit/commits/f13be8d944f33b47d258fc8ba99cf79f3d3dc3f1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2016099?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maysam-tayyeb/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maysam-tayyeb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maysam-tayyeb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maysam-tayyeb/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/maysam-tayyeb","id":2016099,"login":"maysam-tayyeb","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMTYwOTk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maysam-tayyeb/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maysam-tayyeb/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maysam-tayyeb/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maysam-tayyeb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maysam-tayyeb/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/maysam-tayyeb","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maysam-tayyeb/mfe-toolkit/commits/f8b4cbe8000fe8ced59c1dfccea47cf86dcd0cb4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-31T13:33:35Z","email":"smt.jpi@gmail.com","name":"maysam-tayyeb"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-31T13:33:35Z","email":"smt.jpi@gmail.com","name":"maysam-tayyeb"},"message":"refactor: Simplify service architecture to single-package approach\n\n- Move all service implementations to @mfe-toolkit/core as tree-shakable exports\n- Remove separate implementation packages (impl-logger, impl-event-bus, impl-error-reporter)\n- Use generic export names (createLogger, createEventBus) for easy refactoring\n- Update container to import from single @mfe-toolkit/core package\n- Update documentation to reflect simplified architecture\n- Maintain backward compatibility with no breaking changes\n\nBenefits:\n- Lower barrier to entry with single package\n- Tree-shaking ensures only used implementations get bundled\n- MFEs import only types (zero runtime cost)\n- Containers can still provide custom implementations\n- Simpler imports and reduced complexity","tree":{"sha":"f8771c473aeba92ede123350090b2d5e5186f515","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maysam-tayyeb/mfe-toolkit/git/trees/f8771c473aeba92ede123350090b2d5e5186f515"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maysam-tayyeb/mfe-toolkit/git/commits/f8b4cbe8000fe8ced59c1dfccea47cf86dcd0cb4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2016099?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maysam-tayyeb/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maysam-tayyeb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maysam-tayyeb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maysam-tayyeb/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/maysam-tayyeb","id":2016099,"login":"maysam-tayyeb","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMTYwOTk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maysam-tayyeb/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maysam-tayyeb/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maysam-tayyeb/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maysam-tayyeb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maysam-tayyeb/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/maysam-tayyeb","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/maysam-tayyeb/mfe-toolkit/commit/f8b4cbe8000fe8ced59c1dfc