:\n- Move Logger implementation from core to container (ConsoleLogger)\n- Move EventBus implementation from core to container (SimpleEventBus)\n- Move ErrorReporter implementation from core to container (DefaultErrorReporter)\n- Mark core implementations as deprecated for backward compatibility\n- Extract ErrorReporter interface to types file\n\nBenefits achieved:\n- Container can now swap implementations (e.g., Pino logger)\n- True dependency inversion for core services\n- Better testing with mock services\n- Clean separation of interfaces and implementations\n\nDocumentation updates:\n- Reorganize docs with in-progress-plans folder at root level\n- Rename service-architecture-simplified.md to service-architecture.md\n- Create implementation status document\n- Update CLAUDE.md with current architecture state\n\nAll tests passing, backward compatibility maintained.","tree":{"sha":"ed498247edd1cfae980d126e4d496e67d40cdd30","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maysam-tayyeb/mfe-toolkit/git/trees/ed498247edd1cfae980d126e4d496e67d40cdd30"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maysam-tayyeb/mfe-toolkit/git/commits/bde25a51653ebac4324146e58ec1e99ffe7aee83","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2016099?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maysam-tayyeb/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maysam-tayyeb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maysam-tayyeb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maysam-tayyeb/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/maysam-tayyeb","id":2016099,"login":"maysam-tayyeb","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMTYwOTk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maysam-tayyeb/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maysam-tayyeb/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maysam-tayyeb/re