xt\n   - UIContext no longer depends on services from ServiceContext\n   - Removed service hooks that created circular references\n   - Made UIContext standalone to provide UI functionality directly\n\n2. Fixed proxy service handling for optional methods\n   - Proxy now properly handles method calls before bridge initialization\n   - Returns appropriate defaults instead of throwing errors\n   - Handles optional methods like subscribe correctly\n\n3. Added ContextBridge integration\n   - Properly integrated ContextBridge component in App.tsx\n   - Ensures context bridge is initialized with services\n   - Connects UI contexts with MFE services properly\n\n4. Fixed TypeScript errors in validate.ts\n   - Corrected error and warning types from string[] to proper objects\n   - Fixed field access to use error.field and error.message\n\nThis resolves the \"NotificationService.show called before context bridge\ninitialization\" errors and ensures proper event bus communication between\ncontainer and MFEs.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4371b8dba6e4bc3a10cdb18a1e5bde3ddfa2d9e2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maysam-tayyeb/mfe-toolkit/git/trees/4371b8dba6e4bc3a10cdb18a1e5bde3ddfa2d9e2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maysam-tayyeb/mfe-toolkit/git/commits/28472242203fa2a5d5ae4e06463112d2a76643aa","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2016099?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maysam-tayyeb/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maysam-tayyeb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maysam-tayyeb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maysam-tayyeb/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/maysam-tayyeb","id":2016099,"login":"maysam-tayyeb","n