yyeb/mfe-toolkit/commits/c61ab045d4a7f0bf00436a61388e4e4878feb7e1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-30T13:04:04Z","email":"smt.jpi@gmail.com","name":"maysam-tayyeb"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-30T13:04:04Z","email":"smt.jpi@gmail.com","name":"maysam-tayyeb"},"message":"fix: Unify event bus instance between container and MFEs\n\nThe container and MFEs were using separate service systems, creating isolated event bus instances:\n- Container used Service Registry with createEventBus()\n- MFEs used MFE Services with createPlatformEventBus()\n\nThis prevented cross-communication between container and MFEs.\n\nChanges:\n- Modified container-services.ts to use getMFEServicesSingleton()\n- Updated all event-bus MFE demos to use ServiceContainer pattern\n- Fixed event structure handling (event.type instead of payload.type)\n- Removed invalid capabilities property from MFE metadata\n- Replaced notification calls with logger in analytics engine\n\nThis ensures both container and MFEs share the same event bus instance,\nenabling proper bidirectional communication.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"864082ee1e4bfa6130e07e7aad12e4098f33968e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maysam-tayyeb/mfe-toolkit/git/trees/864082ee1e4bfa6130e07e7aad12e4098f33968e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maysam-tayyeb/mfe-toolkit/git/commits/c61ab045d4a7f0bf00436a61388e4e4878feb7e1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2016099?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maysam-tayyeb/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maysam-tayyeb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maysam-tayyeb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maysam-tayyeb/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":