/maysam-tayyeb/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/maysam-tayyeb","id":2016099,"login":"maysam-tayyeb","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMTYwOTk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maysam-tayyeb/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maysam-tayyeb/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maysam-tayyeb/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maysam-tayyeb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maysam-tayyeb/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/maysam-tayyeb","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maysam-tayyeb/mfe-toolkit/commits/d9d51388be39665ed23ca8b7787b202c7d050b61/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-30T04:16:34Z","email":"smt.jpi@gmail.com","name":"maysam-tayyeb"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-30T04:16:34Z","email":"smt.jpi@gmail.com","name":"maysam-tayyeb"},"message":"refactor: Implement improved service architecture with auth/authz separation\n\n- Changed service names from package-scoped to simple names (auth, modal, notification, etc.)\n- Split authentication and authorization into separate services\n- Renamed auth package to authentication for clarity\n- Created new authorization service package with RBAC support\n- Added comprehensive README documentation for all service packages\n- Updated container and MFEs to use new service architecture\n\nBreaking changes:\n- Service names changed from ''@mfe-toolkit/auth'' to ''auth'', etc.\n- Auth service split into authentication and authorization services\n- Package renamed from @mfe-toolkit/service-auth to @mfe-toolkit/service-authentication\n\nBenefits:\n- Cleaner, more readable service names\n- Better separation of concerns (auth vs authz)\n- More flexible authorization with policy support\n- Comprehensive documentation for all services","tree":{"sha":"817f407e912b6571a42d5ea742db9603a2596d