tomatic dependency installation and Streamlit configuration\n\nNow deployable on brev.dev cloud development environments with:\n1. Create environment from GitHub repo\n2. Set NVIDIA_API_KEY environment variable\n3. Run: streamlit run app.py\n\nGenerated with [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d7f2d00afb5b9f9404b5d2a23bdbad8e6edcdcce","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leocodingg/Hangout.ai/git/trees/d7f2d00afb5b9f9404b5d2a23bdbad8e6edcdcce"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leocodingg/Hangout.ai/git/commits/7e5acd3fcd1983e804418a29cb29f2d18d96e6cf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132714535?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leocodingg/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leocodingg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leocodingg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leocodingg/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/leocodingg","id":132714535,"login":"leocodingg","node_id":"U_kgDOB-kQJw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leocodingg/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leocodingg/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leocodingg/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leocodingg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leocodingg/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/leocodingg","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/leocodingg/Hangout.ai/commit/7e5acd3fcd1983e804418a29cb29f2d18d96e6cf","node_id":"C_kwDOPTy3yNoAKDdlNWFjZDNmY2QxOTgzZTgwNDQxOGEyOWNiMjlmMmQxOGQ5NmU2Y2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/leocodingg/Hangout.ai/commit/2ada099024103382a755952ac8b948ef8143e959","sha":"2ada099024103382a755952ac8b948ef8143e959","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leocodingg/Hangout.ai/commits/2ada099024103382a755952ac8b948ef8143e959"}],"sha":"7e5acd3fcd1983e804418a29cb29f2d18d96e6cf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leocodingg/Hangout.ai/commits/7e5acd3fcd1983e804418a29cb29f2d18d96e6cf"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132714535?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leocodingg/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leocodingg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leocodingg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leocodingg/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/leocodingg","id":132714535,"login":"leocodingg","node_id":"U_kgDOB-kQJw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leocodingg/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leocodingg/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leocodingg/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leocodingg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leocodingg/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/leocodingg","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leocodingg/Hangout.ai/commits/2ada099024103382a755952ac8b948ef8143e959/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-07-28T00:27:52Z","email":"132714535+leocodingg@users.noreply.github.com","name":"leocodingg"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-07-28T00:27:52Z","email":"132714535+leocodingg@users.noreply.github.com","name":"leocodingg"},"message":"Initial release: Hangout Orchestrator AI\n\nNVIDIA Nemo Toolkit Hackathon Project - Collaborative AI agent for group hangout planning\n\nFeatures:\n- NVIDIA Nemotron LLM for intelligent conversation and plan optimization\n- Nemo Agent Toolkit patterns for conversation management\n- Real-time multi-user sessions with shareable links\n- Automatic plan generation and updates as participants join\n- Natural language participant information extraction\n- Google Maps integration for location intelligence\n- Transparent AI reasoning chains for plan recommendations\n\nTech Stack:\n- NVIDIA Nemotron 4-340B Instruct model\n- Streamlit for real-time web interface\n- Google Maps API for geocoding and venue search\n- Python 3.8+ with async support\n\nDemo Ready: Clone, configure API keys, and start planning hangouts in under 5 minutes\\!\n\nGenerated with [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a44756c1cdb3c91c1f81488d02666f0231917142","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leocodingg/Hangout.ai/git/trees/a44756c1cdb3c91c1f81488d02666f0231917142"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leocodingg/Hangout.ai/git/commits/2ada099024103382a755952ac8b948ef8143e959","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132714535?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leocodingg/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leocodingg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leocodingg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leocodingg/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/leocodingg","id":132714535,"login":"leocodingg","node_id":"U_kgDOB-kQJw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leocodingg/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leocodingg/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leocodingg/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leocodingg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leocodingg/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/leocodingg","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.co