hub.com/users/ElishevaAmital/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ElishevaAmital/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ElishevaAmital","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AmitalData/Amital-Infra-Repo/commits/f1992509da38a24b278de41ecf50ab990b84aff3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-07-13T20:30:15Z","email":"elisheva@amital.co.il","name":"Elisheva Nachaysi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-07-13T20:30:15Z","email":"elisheva@amital.co.il","name":"Elisheva Nachaysi"},"message":"Merged PR 5959: #121862\n\n### **User description**\n#121862\n\n___\n\n### **PR Type**\nEnhancement\n\n___\n\n### **Description**\n- Implemented `ODataQueryBuilder` for constructing OData queries.\n\n- Added support for filtering, pagination, ordering, and selecting fields.\n\n- Includes methods for adding filters with various operators.\n\n___\n\n### **Changes diagram**\n\n```mermaid\nflowchart LR\n  ODataQueryBuilder[\"ODataQueryBuilder Class\"]\n  FilterItem[\"FilterItem Interface\"]\n  ODataQueryOptions[\"ODataQueryOptions Interface\"]\n  ODataQueryBuilder -- \"Uses\" --> ODataQueryOptions\n  ODataQueryBuilder -- \"Creates\" --> FilterItem\n```\n\n___\n\n### **Changes walkthrough** 📝\n<table><thead><tr><th></th><th align=\"left\">Relevant files</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Enhancement</strong></td><td><table>\n<tr>\n  <td>\n    <details>\n      <summary><strong>odata-filter-builder.ts</strong><dd><code>Implement OData query builder service</code>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; </dd></summary>\n<hr>\n\n/infra-lib/projects/infra-lib/src/lib/services/odata/odata-filter-builder.ts\n\n<li>Defined types for <code>FilterOperator</code>, <code>FilterValue</code>, <code>FilterCondition</code>, <br><code>FilterItem</code>, and <code>ODataQueryOptions</code>.<br> <li> Implemented <code>ODataQueryBuilder</code> class with methods for building OData <br>queries.<br> <li> Added methods for filtering, pagination, ordering, selecting, <br>expanding, computing, searching, and counting.<br> <li> Implemented <code>build()</code> method to generate the OData query string.\n\n</details>\n\n  </td>\n  <td><a href=\"https://amitaldata.visualstudio.com/Amital/_git/Amital-Infra-Repo/pullrequest/5959?_a=files&path=/infra-lib/projects/infra-lib/src/lib/services/odata/odata-filter-builder.ts\">+171/-1</a>&nbsp; </td>\n\n</tr>\n</table></td></tr><tr><td><strong>Tests</strong></td><td><table>\n<tr>\n  <td>\n    <details>\n      <summary><strong>test-odata.ts</strong><dd><code>Add test component for OData query builder</code>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; </dd></summary>\n<hr>\n\n/infra-lib/projects/playground/src/tests/test-odata.ts\n\n<li>Added <code>TestODdataComponent</code> to test <code>ODataQueryBuilder</code>.<br> <li> Implemented a button click handler to build and log an OData query.<br> <li> Demonstrates the usage of <code>ODataQueryBuilder</code> with various filters and <br>options.\n\n</details>\n\n  </td>\n  <td><a href=\"https://amitaldata.visualstudio.com/Amital/_git/Amital-Infra-Repo/pullrequest/5959?_a=files&path=/infra-lib/projects/playground/src/tests/test-odata.ts\">+35/-1</a>&nbsp; &nbsp; </td>\n\n</tr>\n</table></td></tr></tr></tbody></table>\n\n___\n\n<details><summary>Need help?</summary>- Type <code>/help how to ...</code> in the comments thread for any questions about PR-Agent usage.<br>- Check out the <a href=''https://qodo-merge-docs.qodo.ai/usage-guide/''>...","tree":{"sha":"3bee0f9bce828f4afabfcee257bedf75622522eb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AmitalData/Amital-Infra-Repo/git/trees/3bee0f9bce828f4afabfcee257bedf75622522eb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AmitalData/Amital-Infra-Repo/git/commits/f1992509da38a24b278de41ecf50ab990b84a