\n\n### **Changes diagram**\n\n```mermaid\nflowchart LR\n  A[\"Input Parameters\"] --> B{Metadata Resolution};\n  B -- \"isFreeText = false\" --> C[\"Fetch Metadata\"];\n  B -- \"isFreeText = true\" --> D[\"Free Text Input\"];\n  C --> E[\"Dynamic Rendering\"];\n  D --> E;\n  E --> F[\"Validation\"];\n  F --> G[\"Output (FormControl or EventEmitter)\"];\n```\n\n___\n\nRelated work items: #119512","tree":{"sha":"a6d84cd15230ab698bf96dc2b30c5d103932305b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AmitalData/Amital-Infra-Repo/git/trees/a6d84cd15230ab698bf96dc2b30c5d103932305b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AmitalData/Amital-Infra-Repo/git/commits/5486f499fb8fbc8caa1b59584b967f860c02db08","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/196787419?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ElishevaAmital/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ElishevaAmital/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ElishevaAmital/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ElishevaAmital/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ElishevaAmital","id":196787419,"login":"ElishevaAmital","node_id":"U_kgDOC7q82w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ElishevaAmital/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ElishevaAmital/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ElishevaAmital/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ElishevaAmital/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ElishevaAmital/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ElishevaAmital","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AmitalData/Amital-Infra-Repo/commit/5486f499fb8fbc8caa1b59584b967f860c02db08","node_id":"C_kwDOPULJCtoAKDU0ODZmNDk5ZmI4ZmJjOGNhYTFiNTk1ODRiOTY3Zjg2MGMwMmRiMDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AmitalData/Amital-Infra-Repo/commit/9006ed08d5f399a36ab70365e1acae8fdeb3202d","sha":"9006ed08d5f399a36ab70365e1acae8fdeb3202d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AmitalData/Amital-Infra-Repo/commits/9006ed08d5f399a36ab70365e1acae8fdeb3202d"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/AmitalData/Amital-Infra-Repo/commit/36bad461f3f9394323a5c9e23e80987429726171","sha":"36bad461f3f9394323a5c9e23e80987429726171","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AmitalData/Amital-Infra-Repo/commits/36bad461f3f9394323a5c9e23e80987429726171"}],"sha":"5486f499fb8fbc8caa1b59584b967f860c02db08","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AmitalData/Amital-Infra-Repo/commits/5486f499fb8fbc8caa1b59584b967f860c02db08"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/210674307?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/igizAmital/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/igizAmital/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/igizAmital/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/igizAmital/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/igizAmital","id":210674307,"login":"igizAmital","node_id":"U_kgDODI6igw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/igizAmital/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/igizAmital/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/igizAmital/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/igizAmital/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/igizAmital/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/igizAmital","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AmitalData/Amital-Infra-Repo/commits/9006ed08d5f399a36ab70365e1acae8fdeb3202d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-07-02T11:51:12Z","email":"Igor@amital.co.il","name":"Igor Ziskin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-07-02T11:51:12Z","email":"elisheva@amital.co.il","name":"Elisheva Nachaysi"},"message":"Merged PR 5743: Azure and Amital auth service with login page\n\n### **User description**\n1.Added login page with azure setup, also added amital''s old auth ( it''s not final, using mock data in the process but the authentication is done with the old api)\n2. Added build scripts, and environment.ts file generation script that extracts variables from .env file for easy development and deploy.\n3. Update infra-lib package\n4. Updated readme files\n\n___\n\n### **PR Type**\nEnhancement\n\n___\n\n### **Description**\n- Implemented Amital and Azure AD authentication.\n\n- Added login page with authentication type selection.\n\n- Enhanced environment configuration with `.env` files.\n\n- Updated `infra-lib` package to version `0.0.603`.\n\n___\n\n### **Changes diagram**\n\n```mermaid\nflowchart LR\n  A[\"Login Page\"] --> B{{\"Auth Type Selection (Azure/Amital)\"}}\n  B -- \"Azure\" --> C[\"Azure AD Auth\"];\n  B -- \"Amital\" --> D[\"Amital Auth (Email/Password + Tenant)\"];\n  C --> E{{\"Dynamic Routes Setup\"}};\n  D --> E;\n  E --> F[\"Home Page\"];\n```\n\n___\n\nRelated work items: #119555","tree":{"sha":"15363fb77a02a7d9bf8d9d53f63db018bf43d626","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AmitalData/Amital-Infra-Repo/git/trees/15363fb77a02a7d9bf8d9d53f63db018bf43d626"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AmitalData/Amital-Infra-Repo/git/commits/9006ed08d5f399a36ab70365e1acae8fdeb3202d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/196787419?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ElishevaAmital/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ElishevaAmital/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ElishevaAmital/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ElishevaAmital/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.c